IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sca-nouns`
IMPORT `sca-p1-preliminary`
IMPORT `sca-p4-civil-district`

-- Tests for Part 4, ss 19 to 49B.  Every expected value is written from the text beside the assertion, never from the code's output.
-- The District Court limit is $250,000 (s 2).

-- Fixtures.  `an action` takes: in personam, served in Singapore, served abroad, submits, claims money, the amount claimed, the value of the subject matter.
-- The exclusions (supervisory, judicial review, vested exclusively, passing off, expressly excluded, s 28A) and the two later steps (abandoned, agreed) are FALSE.
GIVEN personam IS A BOOLEAN, served IS A BOOLEAN, abroad IS A BOOLEAN, submits IS A BOOLEAN, money IS A BOOLEAN, amount IS A NUMBER, value IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Civil action`
`an action` MEANS `Civil action` OF personam, served, abroad, submits, money, amount, value, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

-- `a typical action` is in personam, served in Singapore, claims money, for the given amount.
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Civil action`
`a typical action for` MEANS `Civil action` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, amount, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

-- `an action with the flags`: supervisory, judicial review, vested exclusively, passing off, expressly excluded, s 28A, abandoned, agreed.
GIVEN supervisory IS A BOOLEAN, review IS A BOOLEAN, vested IS A BOOLEAN, passing IS A BOOLEAN, excluded IS A BOOLEAN, section28A IS A BOOLEAN, abandoned IS A BOOLEAN, agreed IS A BOOLEAN, amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Civil action`
`an action with the flags` MEANS `Civil action` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, amount, 0, passing, supervisory, review, vested, excluded, section28A, abandoned, agreed

§ `Section 19`

#ASSERT `s 19(1) the court is a court of record` `District Court` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19(1) the court is a court of record` `District Court` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 19(1) the court is a court of record` `Magistrate's Court` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 19(2): served in Singapore, or served abroad as authorised, or the defendant submits; in personam only.
#ASSERT `s 19(2) a District Court has the jurisdiction of the General Division of the High Court to hear and try the action` (`an action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1_000 0) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19(2) a District Court has the jurisdiction of the General Division of the High Court to hear and try the action` (`an action` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE 1_000 0) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19(2) a District Court has the jurisdiction of the General Division of the High Court to hear and try the action` (`an action` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE 1_000 0) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19(2) a District Court has the jurisdiction of the General Division of the High Court to hear and try the action` (`an action` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1_000 0) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 19(2) a District Court has the jurisdiction of the General Division of the High Court to hear and try the action` (`an action` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1_000 0) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 19(3): each excluded class.  Flags: supervisory, review, vested, passing, excluded, 28A, abandoned, agreed, amount.
