-- s 19(4): the limit is $250,000; at the limit is not over; one dollar over is.
#ASSERT `s 19(4) the amount claimed or the value of the subject matter of the remedy or relief exceeds the District Court limit` (`a typical action for` 250_000) 250_000 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 19(4) the amount claimed or the value of the subject matter of the remedy or relief exceeds the District Court limit` (`a typical action for` 250_001) 250_000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19(4) the amount claimed or the value of the subject matter of the remedy or relief exceeds the District Court limit` (`an action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1_000 250_001) 250_000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
