#ASSERT `s 25 this section gives a District Court jurisdiction to hear and try the action for the recovery of immovable property` (`Recovery of immovable property` OF TRUE, JUST 300_000, JUST 250_000, NOTHING, NOTHING) 250_000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25 this section gives a District Court jurisdiction to hear and try the action for the recovery of immovable property` (`Recovery of immovable property` OF TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING, JUST 20_833, NOTHING) 250_000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
