#ASSERT `s 25 this section gives a District Court jurisdiction to hear and try the action for the recovery of immovable property` (`Recovery of immovable property` OF TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, JUST 2_500_001) 250_000 EQUALS JUST FALSE
